  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Younger** (1 review): Younger plays intensely, setting the tone, with a standout sax solo at its end [5]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Done Bleeding**: rare: 12 archived performances [6]\n- **Maize Stalk Drinking Blood**: back after 24 archived shows (509 days); rare: 13 archived performances [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2019-05-07.lq** (recommended): source not stated; 23 songs; 191 min [1]\n- **tmg2019-05-07**: matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 23 songs; 107 min; rated 5/5 by 3 [2]. Said about its sound: The recording captures the magic of the performance with near-perfect technical finesse [4]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The reviewer recalled balloon banter during the performance, indicating specific stage talk [5]\n- Fans present declared it the best Mountain Goats show they had ever attended [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2019-05-07**: taped by LMGBTapes; transferred by LMGBTapes; source: SBD [Engineer: Brandon Eggleston] > dr680mkii + CA-14 Omnis (left stage lip) > CA-Ugly Pre > pcm m10 [2]. Also: The uploader provided a detailed tracklist mapping songs to their original album releases [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Mr Smalls: [The Mountain Goats | Mr Smalls](https://mrsmalls.com/events/the-mountain-goats/) [7]",
